{"card_hash": "5866f9672a922b88304dd40c95758fbbf07056db2f3a4268d834c15c24df11c3", "channel": "Lunar", "chars": 32133, "chars_all_clips": 32133, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 20, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=0", "end": 119.159, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "6336935041a46dc152c13cdc678bf5c078db88810ae1cab979f67656e689252e", "start": 0.0, "text": "Today I'm joined by Colin Jarvis, Head of Forward Deployed Engineering at OpenAI. Colin thanks for doing it. Yeah, thanks for having me. I am so thrilled to be doing this with you are actually somebody... ...I was talking a little bit but y", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=600", "end": 720.47, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "8caddb6736323bf7c0486170a44e07c942f155a5cd3ebb7b7f7e63a84f118548", "start": 600.509, "text": "That Are Reusable For Other Customers And Customer Work Or Consulting Work That You Might Do For One Customer Even In The Like Brief Example There Is Their Sort Of An Element A Product Where We Were Kind Of Figuring Out Okay This Eventually", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=839", "end": 958.24, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "fd9888ae813eaf94349b775a640ded630877a7b36388d051899110ae22460ccb", "start": 839.179, "text": "Understanding Of The Ethos Which Should Know How You Develop With LLMs Or Orchestrate Whatever Your Own Like Whatever Your End To End Workflow Is You Wrap Evals Around It Put Guard Rails To Protect The Things That Are Out Then Can't Really ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=1196", "end": 1312.319, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "9c7ab93e86ee9050c8299cf59aa79e00867d66f6b8ac1a8dfda13e7a73d2eb65", "start": 1196.819, "text": "Will Execute A Few So That Actually Take A Couple Seconds This Is Like Kind Of Again A Toy Example So It's Going To Do Five Different Optimization Run But In Practice There Are Other Area Where We Have Seen Folks Recently Use Agents Sort Of", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=1679", "end": 1798.93, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "b97811e9a3514f5f236cabcc3688e4bb2b1614e3b52ef2ed46f273cfc46a126f", "start": 1679.5, "text": "What Not To Do You Have Seen This Enough Times Where I'm Sure You See In A Good Set Of Examples Were Did Not Lead To A Product Or Did Not Lead To Learning Was There A Common Thread Across Those Experiences Of Like Hey This Is Yeah These Are", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=1917", "end": 2036.829, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "7e0077f23ffb6168e55183719f12d95e3a4a2c93ec3cf6980b819de2a2c1d5c7", "start": 1917.95, "text": "To Production So I've Got To Orchestrate It I Gotta Put Tracing In I Gotta Label Those Things Build Eval's And Then I Need Some Guardrails These Are The Rough Components The Companies That Do Only One Part Of That Chain Are The Ones I Don't", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/2083317178711921133#t=0", "end": 119.159, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "6336935041a46dc152c13cdc678bf5c078db88810ae1cab979f67656e689252e", "start": 0.0, "text": "Today I'm joined by Colin Jarvis, Head of Forward Deployed Engineering at OpenAI. Colin thanks for doing it. Yeah, thanks for having me. I am so thrilled to be doing this with you are actually somebody... ...I was talking a little bit but y", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/LunarResearcher/status/20833171787119